# harness / editor local state
.claude/

# lem-materialized dependencies + build output (regenerable via `lem restore` / `lem pack`)
**/deps/
# also ignore a `deps` SYMLINK (worktrees symlink deps to the primary checkout;
# the trailing-slash rule above matches only real directories, not the symlink)
**/deps
**/*-lib/
**/*.doo
**/.lem-publish/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# diagnostic / profiling output
**/*.csv

# build artifacts left by publish
**/*.zip
